          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The receipt shows no license plate or VIN. Check that it belongs to this vehicle." : {
      "comment" : "Receipt review: notice when the receipt does not name a vehicle",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf dem Beleg stehen weder Kenn­zei­chen noch FIN. Prüfe, ob er zu diesem Fahrzeug gehört."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The receipt states the new inspection sticker: %@. Your sticker is not changed unless you do it yourself." : {
      "comment" : "Receipt review: hint with the month a § 57a receipt says was punched; the argument is the month",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf dem Beleg steht die neue Pickerl-Lochung: %@. Dein Pickerl wird nur geändert, wenn du es selbst tust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scan failed" : {
      "comment" : "Alert title when the scan or the import failed",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Scan ist fehl­ge­schla­gen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scan is attached to the entry as a receipt. The name and address of the customer are not kept in its text." : {
      "comment" : "Receipt review: what happens with the scanned pages",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Scan wird als Beleg an den Eintrag angehängt. Name und Anschrift des Kunden werden nicht im Text ge­spei­chert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service record as a PDF is part of Pitlog Pro. Your history stays free." : {
      "comment" : "Paywall: shown when the user wanted to export the service record",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Ser­vice­nach­weis als PDF gehört zu Pitlog Pro. Deine Historie bleibt gratis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subscription could not be renewed. Pro stays on while the App Store retries the payment. Check your payment method." : {
      "comment" : "Settings: status of a subscription in its grace period",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Abo konnte nicht verlängert werden. Pro bleibt aktiv, solange der App Store die Zahlung erneut versucht. Prüfe deine Zah­lungs­me­tho­de."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two readings differ. Choose the right one below." : {
      "comment" : "Receipt review: the rules and the on-device model read different values",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die beiden Lesarten weichen ab. Wähle unten die richtige."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vehicle and its odometer readings will be deleted. This cannot be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation message for deleting a vehicle",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
